<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">FOLLOW-UP</view><view class="title">把复诊时间交代清楚</view><view class="subtitle">提醒由医生建立，平台负责发送和记录是否完成，不自动替医生改变复诊计划。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view class="section-title">新增复诊提醒</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="label">病例</text><picker range="{{cases}}" range-key="name" bindchange="chooseCase"><view class="picker">点击选择本院病例</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">复诊时间</text><input class="input" data-key="dueAt" value="{{form.dueAt}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">复诊原因与准备资料</text><textarea class="textarea" data-key="reason" value="{{form.reason}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：复查肾功能、电解质和血压，带近7天饮水记录"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存复诊提醒</button></view><view class="section-title">待随访</view><view wx:if="{{items.length}}"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">{{item.pet_name}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.status}}</view></view><view class="meta">{{item.due_at_label}}<br/>{{item.reason}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="card empty">当前没有待随访病例。</view></view>
